0xB1: 3F 3F 41 41 41 40 40 40 41 41 41 41 41 41 41 41
0xD2: FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FD FE FE FE FE
0xDB: 11 01 01 11 11 11 11 11 01 01 11 11 11 11 11 01
0xF1: 05 2A 5A 04 09 02 06 0A 1A 4A 0A 03 07 00 05 09
0xF2: 14 00 00 03 08 11 14 14 00 00 01 07 0F 14 14 00
.EE
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.RS
.IP 0
Everything fine
.IP 1
Generic error
.IP 2
Command-line error
.IP 3
Initialization error
.IP 5
Fatal error (memory allocation failure)
.RE

.SH BUGS
.PP
Report bugs to https://github.com/nbfc\-linux/nbfc\-linux

.SH AUTHOR
.PP
Benjamin Abendroth (braph93@gmx.de)

.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
.BR nbfc (1),
.BR nbfc_service (1),
.BR nbfc_service.json (5),
.BR fancontrol (1)
